lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>YP M3 rc2 has been through QA. =
We have resolved the beaglebone and bitbake UI issues, the ptest issues =
remain and need attention in M4. It is likely M3 rc2 will be =
released.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
